    "body": "The restriction here is not correct, since referrerpolicy=\"\" will affect any imported scripts (including in classic scripts via `import()`). We'll want to remove that restriction and be sure to test that the referrer policy is respected in:\r\n\r\n- inline classic scripts that import(\"./x\")\r\n- inline module scripts that import(\"./x\")\r\n- inline module scripts that import \"./x\"",
