    "body": "Was just thinking about these cases today actually (also sorry for the delay). I've been testing locally with Chrome's (upcoming) implementation to make sure that the referrerpolicy is communicated to imported scripts as well. I guess I can open a WPT issue about this since I don't believe the the current `/referrer-policy` subdir includes tests for this, but the spec change is of course relatively simple.",
